Menu="AsustorControl:1"
Title="LCD Settings"
Tag="tv"
Markdown="false"
---
<div id="tab-lcd">

    <dl>
        <dt>LCD enabled:</dt>
        <dd><select id="cfg-lcd-enabled">
            <option value="true">Yes</option>
            <option value="false">No</option>
        </select></dd>
    </dl>
    <blockquote class="inline_help">
        Enable or disable the LCD display daemon.
    </blockquote>

    <dl>
        <dt>Serial port:</dt>
        <dd><input type="text" id="cfg-lcd-port" value="/dev/ttyS1" size="20"></dd>
    </dl>
    <blockquote class="inline_help">
        Serial device for the Asustor LCD panel. Usually /dev/ttyS1.
    </blockquote>

    <dl>
        <dt>Cycle interval:</dt>
        <dd><input type="number" id="cfg-lcd-cycle" min="1" max="60" value="5" size="5"> seconds</dd>
    </dl>
    <blockquote class="inline_help">
        Time in seconds between LCD screen rotations.
    </blockquote>

    <dl>
        <dt>Screen rotation:</dt>
        <dd>
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="scr-hostname" checked> Hostname</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="scr-ip" checked> IP Address</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="scr-temps" checked> Temperatures</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="scr-array" checked> Array Status</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="scr-time" checked> Time/Uptime</label><br>
            <label><input type="checkbox" id="scr-fan"> Fan Status</label>
        </dd>
    </dl>
    <blockquote class="inline_help">
        Select which screens to include in the LCD rotation cycle.
    </blockquote>

    <dl>
        <dt>&nbsp;</dt>
        <dd><button onclick="saveLcdConfig()" class="ac-btn ac-btn-primary">Apply &amp; Restart</button></dd>
    </dl>

</div>
